      "note": [
        "Job vacancies corresponds to the definition of job vacancies in Regulation (EC) No 453/2008 of the European Parliament and the European Council. Contrary to job openings, job vacancies does not include job openings to be held by substitutes.",
        "Statistical values and associated margins of error are not reported if the mean squared error is 50 percent or more of the statistical value. The limit for when statistical values and associated margins of error are not reported only refer to  the number of job openings, and not the annual changes.",
        "Numbers and associated margins of error are rounded to the nearest hundred.",
        "Annual changes and associated margins of error are rounded to the nearest integer."
